|  3. Attested Capability Claim    : REALM Resource Dependency Graph & API Bounds   |
|  4. Historical Execution Trace   : Cryptographic Audit Hash of Prior System State |
|  5. Reputation / Trust Score     : Continuous Behavioral Metric & Policy Delta    |
